        "created_at": "2013-05-04T18:21:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe he is removed from the game when reduced to 0HP if The Operative is still in play, but I'm not for sure.&nbsp; I don't currently have my cards with me.&nbsp; But as far as I know, the only cards that can regain HP after they've hit 0HP are Indestructible cards.</p>",
