        "created_at": "2013-05-04T21:42:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Chairman, like Omnitron, is removed from&nbsp;the game&nbsp;when he is destroyed.&nbsp; He cannot come back and be healed.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
